# Beat 5, the locks: `graphene demo --cheat` in the terminal at 1920x1080, 25 lines, all in frame.
# The top line says what made it: a scripted stand-in, no model ran. Keep it in frame.
# Run from ~/graphene-film with the branch's graphene first on PATH (dev/process/editor/take/README.md).
Output broll/beat5-locks-demo-cheat.mp4
Output broll/beat5-locks-demo-cheat.gif
Set Shell bash
Set Width 1920
Set Height 1080
Set FontSize 28
Set Padding 24
Set TypingSpeed 60ms
Set Framerate 30
Hide
Type "clear"
Enter
Show
Sleep 1s
Type "graphene demo --cheat"
Sleep 800ms
Enter
Sleep 10s
